{"op": "append", "content": "[\u26a0\ufe0f] [2026-02-06 07:52:27 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-DatabaseAudit] [Project: scribe_pro_cleanup] Database file inventory discovered. PRODUCTION: .scribe/scribe.db (436K), .scribe/data/scribe.db (448K), .scribe/data/scribe_projects.db (0 bytes EMPTY), data/scribe_projects.db (75MB PRIMARY), data/backups/*.db (688K each). TEST POLLUTION: 7+ tmp_tests/ directories with scribe.db + state.json not cleaned up. CRITICAL FINDING: data/scribe_projects.db is the 75MB primary database, but there are THREE other production DB files suggesting path confusion. | cleanup_needed=[\"7+ tmp_tests/ directories\", \"multiple redundant DB files\", \"state.json in production\"]; database_files={\".scribe/data/scribe.db\": \"448K\", \".scribe/data/scribe_projects.db\": \"0 bytes EMPTY\", \".scribe/scribe.db\": \"436K\", \"data/scribe_projects.db\": \"75MB PRIMARY\"}; reasoning={\"how\": \"Used find to enumerate all .db and state.json files, examined sizes to identify primary database\", \"what\": \"Found 4 production DB files (.scribe/scribe.db, .scribe/data/scribe.db, .scribe/data/scribe_projects.db empty, data/scribe_projects.db 75MB), plus 7+ test directories not cleaned, plus production state.json\", \"why\": \"Multiple database files suggest configuration issues or migration artifacts - need to understand which is authoritative and why others exist\"}; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_pro_cleanup/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-06T07:52:27.041070+00:00_7943ec8a", "timestamp": "2026-02-06T07:52:27.041145+00:00"}
