{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-02-06 07:52:58 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-StructureMap] [Project: scribe_pro_cleanup] Import pattern analysis complete. All internal imports use absolute form: 'from scribe_mcp.X.Y import Z'. No relative imports detected. storage/__init__.py provides factory function create_storage_backend(). External dependencies: 17 packages including mcp, asyncpg, jinja2, rich, tiktoken, faiss-cpu, sentence-transformers. Config module uses optional dotenv loading. | external_dependencies=[\"asyncpg\", \"jinja2\", \"mcp\", \"psutil\", \"rich\", \"pytest\", \"pytest-asyncio\", \"portalocker\", \"pyyaml\", \"watchdog\", \"tiktoken\", \"faiss-cpu\", \"sentence-transformers\", \"numpy\", \"dotenv (optional)\"]; factory_functions=[\"storage/__init__.py:create_storage_backend()\"]; import_convention=absolute only (from scribe_mcp.*); reasoning={\"how\": \"Examined __init__.py files, key modules (server, storage, config), and requirements.txt\", \"what\": \"Identified absolute import pattern, no relative imports, factory pattern in storage\", \"why\": \"Import conventions determine refactoring complexity for src/ migration\"}; relative_imports=False; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_pro_cleanup/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-06T07:52:58.400030+00:00_1710aa36", "timestamp": "2026-02-06T07:52:58.400121+00:00"}
