{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-02-06 07:54:22 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-StructureMap] [Project: scribe_pro_cleanup] Package boundary analysis complete. 15 top-level packages identified with clear separation of concerns: tools/ (MCP tool implementations, 18 tools), storage/ (DB backends: sqlite, postgres, base abstract class), state/ (session management, agent identity), shared/ (cross-cutting concerns: logging utils, execution context), config/ (settings, display, log, repo, vector config), utils/ (formatters/, helpers), doc_management/ (manage_docs engine), bridges/ (external MCP integration), template_engine/ (jinja2 rendering), db/ (connection pool, ops), scripts/ (CLI tools), tests/ (265 test files), security/ (sandbox), plugins/ (vector indexer registry). Clean layering: tools \u2192 state/storage \u2192 utils/config. | circular_dependencies=none detected; layering=tools \u2192 state/storage \u2192 utils/config; package_structure={\"core\": [\"tools\", \"storage\", \"state\", \"shared\", \"config\"], \"integration\": [\"bridges\", \"plugins\"], \"operational\": [\"scripts\", \"security\"], \"support\": [\"utils\", \"doc_management\", \"template_engine\", \"db\"], \"testing\": [\"tests\"]}; reasoning={\"how\": \"Analyzed __init__.py exports, import patterns, and cross-module dependencies\", \"what\": \"Cataloged all 15 packages, identified layer hierarchy, verified clean separation\", \"why\": \"Clear package boundaries enable safe refactoring and ensure no circular dependencies during src/ migration\"}; tests_count=265; tools_count=18; top_level_packages=15; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_pro_cleanup/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-06T07:54:22.909227+00:00_3bcd7bf4", "timestamp": "2026-02-06T07:54:22.909310+00:00"}
