{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-02-06 07:57:27 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-StderrAudit] [Project: scribe_pro_cleanup] \u2705 RESEARCH COMPLETE: Stderr and logging noise audit delivered. Identified root cause (no centralized logging config), quantified all 115+ noise sources, categorized by severity, and provided 4-phase implementation plan. Primary findings: server.py startup (35 messages, HIGH), unconfigured logging (34 files, HIGH), tool error handling (75+ messages, MEDIUM). Recommended solution: Add SCRIBE_LOG_LEVEL env var with centralized logging config, convert all print() to proper logging calls. Estimated cleanup effort: 4-6 hours. Ready for Architect to design implementation. | confidence=0.95; critical_insights=[\"No centralized logging config = root cause\", \"Most print() serves legitimate purpose, needs conversion not deletion\", \"Startup sequence is highest impact target for cleanup\"]; document_path=.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_pro_cleanup/research/RESEARCH_STDERR_AUDIT_20260206_0755.md; next_stage=Architect to design centralized logging system and conversion strategy; reasoning={\"how\": \"Systematic investigation using scribe tools, complete codebase scan, detailed file inspection, categorization by purpose and severity, prioritized action plan\", \"what\": \"Created comprehensive audit document with categorization, quantification, recommendations, implementation phases, testing strategy, and handoff notes\", \"why\": \"Deliver complete, actionable research to enable professional production operation of Scribe MCP\"}; research_quality=comprehensive; total_findings=115; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_pro_cleanup/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-06T07:57:27.721154+00:00_deb7ce0b", "timestamp": "2026-02-06T07:57:27.721219+00:00"}
