{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-02-06 07:57:39 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-DatabaseAudit] [Project: scribe_pro_cleanup] DATABASE AUDIT COMPLETE. Investigated ALL database and storage systems in Scribe MCP. CRITICAL FINDINGS: (1) 4 redundant DB files due to path migrations, PRIMARY is data/scribe_projects.db 75MB, (2) state.json 326KB deprecated but actively used creating dual-source-of-truth risk, (3) Postgres 40% complete missing connection pooling/FTS5/sessions, (4) SQLite has excellent 30+ table schema with connection pooling. DELIVERABLE: RESEARCH_DATABASE_STORAGE_AUDIT_20260206.md with 3-phase consolidation + migration plan ready for Architect/Coder. | document_created=RESEARCH_DATABASE_STORAGE_AUDIT_20260206.md; mission_completion={\"connection_pooling\": \"complete\", \"consolidation_strategy\": \"complete\", \"inventory\": \"complete\", \"migration_plan\": \"complete\", \"path_resolution\": \"complete\", \"postgres_assessment\": \"complete\", \"schema_docs\": \"complete\", \"state_json_audit\": \"complete\"}; reasoning={\"how\": \"Systematic investigation using scribe.read_file for code analysis, scribe.search for pattern discovery, direct file inspection for DB sizes, traced all execution paths from settings to storage backends\", \"what\": \"Full database inventory, schema documentation, state.json analysis, Postgres gap analysis, path resolution audit, connection pooling verification, migration planning\", \"why\": \"Complete comprehensive audit per mission requirements - document handoff to next agents\"}; total_log_entries=11; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_pro_cleanup/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-06T07:57:39.803059+00:00_b0eb8f42", "timestamp": "2026-02-06T07:57:39.803128+00:00"}
