{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-02-06 07:57:59 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-StartupPerf] [Project: scribe_pro_cleanup] RESEARCH PHASE COMPLETE. Investigated startup performance and general bottlenecks across 10 focus areas. Total log entries: 10+. Created comprehensive research document with 7 findings (4 critical/warn, 3 positive). Primary discoveries: (1) Database _initialise blocks startup with 631 lines of sync ops, (2) Eager tool loading imports 18 modules with 50+ dependencies each, (3) Plugin/bridge init adds overhead, (4) Connection pooling works well, (5) Query patterns efficient, (6) No memory leaks. Delivered actionable recommendations in 3 tiers with estimated 60-80% startup improvement potential. Handoff to Architect for optimization design. | confidence=0.98; deliverable=RESEARCH_STARTUP_PERF_20260206_0755.md; findings_count=7; log_entries_created=12; next_agent=Architect; phase=research; reasoning={\"how\": \"Reviewed all logged entries and research document sections for completeness\", \"what\": \"Consolidated all investigation findings into final deliverable status\", \"why\": \"Mark research phase complete with summary for downstream agents\"}; recommendations_priority=immediate_tasks_1-4; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_pro_cleanup/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-06T07:57:59.616273+00:00_e5840da7", "timestamp": "2026-02-06T07:57:59.616348+00:00"}
