resentation, duplication (flagged)\", \"why\": \"Complete codebase audit to establish professional presentation and code quality baseline before production deployment\"}; report_file=RESEARCH_CODE_QUALITY_REPO_HYGIENE_20260206.md; report_pages=23; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_pro_cleanup/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-06T07:59:26.210760+00:00_65efa78b", "timestamp": "2026-02-06T07:59:26.210833+00:00"}
