{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-02-06 08:35:12 UTC] [Agent: ArchitectAgent-ProCleanup] [Project: scribe_pro_cleanup] Phase plan logging (deferred from previous session). PHASE_PLAN.md contains 10 ordered phases with 33,203 bytes (754 lines, 50 headings). 31-day timeline across 6-7 weeks. 30+ scoped task packages with exact file paths, line numbers, specifications, and verification criteria. Ordering rationale: low-risk cleanup first (P1-P3), god module decomposition (P4-P5), packaging migration (P6), DB consolidation (P7), Postgres completion (P8), reminder wire-up (P9), optimization and scaffold (P10). | deliverable=PHASE_PLAN.md; phases=10; reasoning={\"how\": \"Used manage_docs replace_range to overwrite template. Grouped related work into phases. Each task package specifies exact files, line numbers, method signatures, and verification commands. Ensured no forward dependencies between phases.\", \"what\": \"10 phases ordered by risk (LOW->HIGH->MEDIUM->LOW). Each phase has duration, risk level, dependencies, task packages with exact specifications, and exit criteria. Rollback strategy per phase.\", \"why\": \"PHASE_PLAN.md is the second deliverable. Orders work to minimize risk and maximize confidence at each step.\"}; size_bytes=33203; task_packages=30+; total_headings=50; total_lines=754; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_pro_cleanup/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-06T08:35:12.808728+00:00_42b31ac4", "timestamp": "2026-02-06T08:35:12.808817+00:00"}
